</nav><div class="sharemodal" id="shareModal"><div class="sharesheet"><h3>分享 ZIP</h3><p>修改文件名后，再打开 iPhone 系统分享菜单</p><input id="zipNameInput" value="优优LUI图标包" autocomplete="off"><div class="shareactions"><button class="sharecancel" type="button" onclick="closeShareModal()">取消</button><button class="sharego" type="button" onclick="sharePreparedZip()">分享 ZIP</button></div></div></div><script src="jszip.min.js"></script><script>
